   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbe21ffd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 1. Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "Lanjutan dari audit. Data mentah Januari sampai Juni 2026 dibersihkan di sini, hasilnya disimpan ke `datasets/interim/`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Catatan:\n",
    "- `datasets/raw` tidak disentuh, hasil cleaning ditulis ke file baru.\n",
    "- Tiap aturan dijalankan berurutan, baris sebelum dan sesudah dicatat ke `03_cleaning_log.csv`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5b28b5bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 2. Import Library"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "53e570b3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import os"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1fe88733",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 3. Muat Data Mentah 6 Bulan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "052b5814",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Bulan 1: 3,724,889 baris, 20 kolom\n",
      "Bulan 2: 3,399,866 baris, 20 kolom\n",
      "Bulan 3: 3,952,451 baris, 20 kolom\n",
      "Bulan 4: 3,831,240 baris, 20 kolom\n",
      "Bulan 5: 4,090,836 baris, 20 kolom\n",
      "Bulan 6: 3,837,248 baris, 21 kolom\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(1, 7):\n",
    "    path = rf\"..\\datasets\\raw\\2026\\yellow_tripdata_2026-{i:02d}.parquet\"\n",
    "    df[i] = pd.read_parquet(path)\n",
    "    print(f\"Bulan {i}: {len(df[i]):,} baris, {df[i].shape[1]} kolom\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9b2697b7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3.1 Buang Kolom `request_source`\n",
    "\n",
    "Kolom ini cuma ada di bulan Juni dan 73,6% isinya kosong, jadi dibuang biar skema 6 bulan sama (20 kolom)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "6bb4bd25",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Bulan 6: request_source dibuang (non-null: 1,013,180)\n",
      "Semua bulan sama kolom: True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "for i in range(1, 7):\n",
    "    if \"request_source\" in df[i].columns:\n",
    "        n = df[i][\"request_source\"].notna().sum()\n",
    "        df[i] = df[i].drop(columns=[\"request_source\"])\n",
    "        print(f\"Bulan {i}: request_source dibuang (non-null: {n:,})\")\n",
    "\n",
    "kolom = list(df[1].columns)\n",
    "print(\"Semua bulan sama kolom:\", all(list(df[i].columns) == kolom for i in range(1, 7)))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b0118aa1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 4. Gabung Semua Bulan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "78b68295",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Total baris: 22,836,530\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "df_all = pd.concat(df.values(), ignore_index=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# simpan asal bulan tiap baris\n",
    "df_all[\"_bulan\"] = np.repeat([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], [len(df[i]) for i in range(1, 7)])\n",
    "\n",
    "n_awal = len(df_all)\n",
    "print(f\"Total baris: {n_awal:,}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "80110de2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 5. Cleaning (C1-C10)\n",
    "\n",
    "Aturan C1-C10 diambil dari `docs/analysis_plan.md`, dijalankan satu per satu lalu dicatat ke tabel attrition.\n",
    "\n",
    "`main_trips` dipakai sebagai sumber utama analisis demand. Aturan nilai transaksi (jarak, tarif, penumpang) tetap diterapkan biar file ini sekalian layak untuk analisis revenue."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "bd9f82ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Baris awal: 22,836,530\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "attrition = []\n",
    "\n",
    "# helper buat nyatet tiap aturan ke tabel attrition\n",
    "def catat(rule, n_before, alasan):\n",
    "    n_buang = n_before - len(df_all)\n",
    "    attrition.append({\n",
    "        \"Aturan\": rule,\n",
    "        \"Baris sebelum\": n_before,\n",
    "        \"Baris dibuang\": n_buang,\n",
    "        \"Baris sesudah\": len(df_all),\n",
    "        \"% dibuang\": round(n_buang / n_before * 100, 4),\n",
    "        \"Alasan\": alasan,\n",
    "    })\n",
    "    print(f\"{rule}: dibuang {n_buang:,}, sisa {len(df_all):,}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Baris awal: {len(df_all):,}\")"
   ]
  },
